WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.744
In the year 960, the army camp at Chenqiao Station was shrouded in morning mist.

00:00:07.094 --> 00:00:11.438
The soldiers came out of their tents and gathered together, looking excited.

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:16.660
Everyone discussed excitedly, and the atmosphere grew more and more lively.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:23.178
Just then, Zhao Kuangyin walked out of the big tent and was surrounded by the soldiers.

00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:28.136
Two generals held a yellow robe and walked solemnly toward him.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:33.046
The soldiers draped the yellow robe over his shoulders and proclaimed him emperor.

00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:38.220
The whole army cheered in unison and knelt down one after another.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:43.826
Banners flew, and the cheers rang up to the clouds.

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:48.520
Zhao Kuangyin put on a magnificent dragon robe and ascended the throne as emperor.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:52.110
He founded the Song dynasty and became Emperor Taizu of Song.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:57.332
The sun rose, and golden sunlight lit up the land.

00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:03.586
'The Yellow Robe' is also used to describe being pushed into a position of leadership by everyone.

